«
@@ ============================================================
@@ MinΔVTraj — optimal launch window (min ΔV over departure date AND flight time)
@@ 2-D golden-section search over TrCost: on the departure date, each point
@@ being the best flight time found by MinTofDV. Keep the window under the
@@ 180° ridge. Iteration count set by AstronTXPrecision (1 when the variable
@@ does not exist): 81 TrCost at 1, where the former ternary search took 169,
@@ for an error bound at least as small.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : 'Af' 'Bf' t1_lo t1_hi tof_lo tof_hi   ( 'Af' 'Bf' t1_lo t1_hi tof_lo tof_hi -- { ΔV t₁ tof } )
@@ Output : { ΔV t₁ tof }
@@ VALIDATION (simulator):
@@   1 'AstronTXPrecision' STO
@@   'Ⓛ♁Pf' 'Ⓛ♂Pf' 2459030 2459075 150 225 MinΔVTraj -> { 6.31702 2459055.62 205.66 }  (Mars 2020, level 1)
@@ ============================================================
 → Af Bf t1lo t1hi toflo tofhi
 «
   @ nstep = ⌈(n·ln 1.5 + ln 2) / ln(1/gold)⌉, n the former ternary step count
   IfErr 'AstronTXPrecision' Rcl Then Drop 1 End →Num 3 * 3 +
   1.5 Ln * 2 Ln + 0.6180339887498949 Inv Ln / Ceil
   t1lo →Num t1hi →Num 0.6180339887498949
   → nstep lo hi gold
   «
     hi hi lo - gold * -  lo hi lo - gold * +
     → x1 x2
     «
       x1 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV
       x2 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV
       → mvR1 mvR2
       «
         1 nstep Start
           If mvR1 1 Get mvR2 1 Get < Then
             @ The minimum lies in [lo, x2]
             x2 'hi' Sto  x1 'x2' Sto  mvR1 'mvR2' Sto
             hi hi lo - gold * - 'x1' Sto
             x1 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV 'mvR1' Sto
           Else
             @ The minimum lies in [x1, hi]
             x1 'lo' Sto  x2 'x1' Sto  mvR2 'mvR1' Sto
             lo hi lo - gold * + 'x2' Sto
             x2 Af Bf toflo tofhi ⓁMinTofDV 'mvR2' Sto
           End
         Next
         If mvR1 1 Get mvR2 1 Get < Then mvR1 x1 Else mvR2 x2 End
         → mvR mvt « mvR 1 Get mvt mvR 2 Get 3 →List »
       »
     »
   »
 »
»
